---
import { Image } from "astro:assets"
import aboutLogo from "@/assets/events/io-extended-24/io24-learning-cta.webp"
import aboutLogoDark from "@/assets/events/io-extended-24/io24-learning-cta-dark.webp"
---

<section id="about" class="max-w-screen-lg mx-auto my-8 px-4 scroll-mt-24">
  <div
    class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-neutral-900 text-neutral-900 dark:text-white border-2 border-black dark:border-white shadow-[4px_4px_0px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,1)] dark:shadow-[4px_4px_0px_0px_rgba(255,255,255,1)] gap-6"
  >
    <div class="space-y-4 max-w-lg">
      <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold leading-snug">
        ¡Acompáñanos a descubrir las novedades del Google I/O 2024 en la hermosa capital de Bolivia!
      </h2>
      <p class="text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-300 text-base sm:text-lg">
        En este evento, exploramos las últimas tecnologías de Google junto a expertos
        internacionales y nacionales.
      </p>
      <p class="font-bold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white text-base sm:text-lg">
        ¡Un gran hito tecnológico en Sucre!
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="w-56 sm:w-72 shrink-0">
      <Image
        src={aboutLogo}
        alt="Google I/O Extended 2024 Learning"
        width={300}
        height={300}
        class="block dark:hidden object-contain mx-auto"
        loading="lazy"
      />
      <Image
        src={aboutLogoDark}
        alt="Google I/O Extended 2024 Learning"
        width={300}
        height={300}
        class="hidden dark:block object-contain mx-auto"
        loading="lazy"
      />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
